{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43208","headline":"大梁行 · 唐尧客","name":"大梁行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客有成都来，爲我弹鸣琴。\n前弹别鹤操，後奏大梁吟。\n大梁伤客情，荒台对古城。\n版筑有陈迹，歌吹舞遗声。\n雄哉魏公子，畴日好罗英。\n秀士三千人，煌煌列衆星。\n金槌夺晋鄙，白刃刎侯嬴。\n邯郸救赵北，函谷走秦兵。\n君子荣且昧，忠信莫之明。\n间谍忽来及，雄图靡克成。\n千龄万化尽，但见汴水清。\n旧国多孤垒，夷门荆棘生。\n苍梧彩云没，湘浦绿池平。\n闻有东山去，萧萧班马鸣。\n河洲搴宿莽，日夕泪沾缨。\n因之唁公子，慷慨此歌行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐尧客","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}